---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import WeaveBand from '../components/WeaveBand.astro';

const swatches = [
  { name: 'Paper', hex: '#FDF6EB', role: 'Background' },
  { name: 'Ink', hex: '#3E2C20', role: 'Text' },
  { name: 'Rosewood', hex: '#7B3E3B', role: 'Headings, brand' },
  { name: 'River', hex: '#2B4F55', role: 'Footer, links' },
  { name: 'Sakura', hex: '#C46864', role: 'Accent' },
  { name: 'Sage', hex: '#9EB084', role: 'Accent' },
  { name: 'Sun', hex: '#EBA586', role: 'Accent' },
];
---

<Base title="Colophon · Niño Redoble" description="How this site is made: the type, the colours, the hero scene and the tools, with credit where it's due.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main">
    <header class="wrap head">
      <h1 class="display reveal">COLOPHON</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="--d:.08s">How this site is made, and who made the parts I didn't.</p>
    </header>
    <WeaveBand height={20} />

    <div class="wrap body">
      <section class="reveal">
        <h2 class="display">THE HERO</h2>
        <p>
          The paper landscape on the home page is <a href="https://www.openlanding.page/templates/kirigami">KIRIGAMI</a> by
          Famanias, from openlanding.page, used under the MIT License. Its art and animation are unchanged. I added the
          Philippine eagle, the coconut palms and the vinta, and changed how it reacts to scrolling. The licence notice
          ships with the page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2 class="display">TYPE</h2>
        <p>
          Headlines are set in <strong>Empanada Bold</strong> by Neale Davidson of
          <a href="https://www.pixelsagas.com/?p=3411">Pixel Sagas</a>. Everything else is
          <strong>Familjen Grotesk</strong> by Familjen STHLM. Both are free under the SIL Open Font License.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2 class="display">COLOUR</h2>
        <p>Every colour is taken from the hero scene: paper and ink to read, rosewood for the brand, river teal to cool it, and sakura, sage and sun as accents.</p>
        <ul class="swatches">
          {
            swatches.map((s) => (
              <li>
                <span class="chip" style={`background:${s.hex}`} />
                <strong>{s.name}</strong>
                <span>
                  {s.role} · {s.hex}
                </span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2 class="display">BUILT WITH</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>, hosted on GitHub Pages at a domain from
          <a href="https://is-a.dev/">is-a.dev</a>. The work follows the same process as my other projects: written specs,
          automated checks before anything merges, and AI coding tools working inside those rules.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2 class="display">HONESTY</h2>
        <p>
          Every claim on this site was checked against the source code or documents behind it. Studies say plainly which
          data is real and which is sample data. If you spot something wrong, <a href="/#contact">tell me</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .head {
    padding-block: clamp(32px, 6vw, 88px) clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(64px, 12vw, 180px);
    line-height: 0.84;
  }
  .lede {
    margin-top: 20px;
    max-width: 34em;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 1.9vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px);
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
  }
  section {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--rosewood);
    padding-top: 16px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 52px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--river-ink);
    text-decoration-color: var(--sun);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  a:hover {
    color: var(--rosewood);
  }
  .swatches {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .swatches li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px auto 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .chip {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
